 <gimpdir>/chopgimp-brushes and the XCF: apply, edit with the brushed paths
 following, tiles, duplicate, rename, delete), on-canvas widgets of repeats
 with the Move tool (radial centre / radius / count, grid spacing and size,
 mirror axis), a click on an instance selects its repeat

